{% doc %}
  Single source of truth for the "sale" pricing shown on the storefront.

  Shopify Automatic Discounts don't expose their percentage or target
  products to Liquid, so this list is a manual mirror of whichever
  Automatic Discounts are currently turned on in Shopify Admin > Discounts.
  Update this line whenever a discount starts or ends. No product or
  discount data in Shopify is touched by this file.

  Format: one entry per product, separated by "|":
    handle:pct:value  - percent off (e.g. solanas-blouse:pct:10)
    handle:amt:value  - fixed amount off, in whole currency units
                        (e.g. lady-midi-skirt:amt:10 = $10 off)

  @example
  {% render 'sale-config' %}
{% enddoc %}solanas-blouse:pct:10|tenenbaum-polo-dress-blue:pct:10|tenenbaum-polo-dress:pct:10|cyber-turtleneck:pct:20|perfect-school-skirt:pct:15|perfect-skirt:pct:15|lady-midi-skirt:amt:10|american-dream-skirt:amt:10